---
import { profile } from '../data/site'
import Reg from './Reg.astro'
---

{/*
  The thesis, stated as the page's own subject matter, and the highest-motion
  moment on the site (9 on the intensity budget).

  Entrance, about 1.35s end to end:
    0ms    name locks in                        SNAP
    70ms   role, then location                  SNAP
    300ms  headline lines rise out of the clip  REVEAL
    +      each line splits and snaps clean     SNAP
    1000ms lede                                 quiet
    1200ms navigation, last                     SNAP

  Afterwards the section goes almost still: a 3px pointer nudge, and the lines
  separating on scroll.
*/}
<section class="hero chapter shell" id="arrival" data-chapter>
  <p class="hero__meta eyebrow">
    <span data-entry="snap" style="--d:0ms">{profile.name}</span>
    <span data-entry="snap" style="--d:70ms">{profile.role}</span>
    <span data-entry="snap" style="--d:140ms">{profile.location}</span>
  </p>

  {/*
    Each line is its own clip. data-reveal-group="live" hands the lines to
    direct control once they land, so the scroll separation tracks the wheel
    exactly instead of easing through the 820ms reveal curve.
  */}
  <h1
    class="hero__title"
    aria-label="What looks complete usually isn't"
    data-reveal-group="live"
    data-delay="300"
    data-settle="hero-settled"
  >
    <span class="rv"><span><Reg text="What looks" /></span></span>
    <span class="rv"><span><Reg text="complete" /></span></span>
    <span class="rv"><span><Reg text="usually isn't." /></span></span>
  </h1>

  <p class="hero__lede" data-entry="snap" style="--d:1000ms">{profile.statement}</p>

  {/*
    REVEAL, at the smallest scale on the site. Two identical arrows in a clip
    the height of one: on hover both travel down by exactly that height, so the
    first leaves through the floor while the second arrives through the ceiling
    and lands where the first began. One arrow animating down and back would
    read as a bounce; this reads as the same arrow coming round again.
  */}
  <a class="hero__cue" href="#about" data-entry="snap" style="--d:1080ms">
    <span>Four projects, four discrepancies</span>
    <span class="hero__cue-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 20 36"><path d="M10 1v31m0 0 7-8m-7 8-7-8" /></svg>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 20 36"><path d="M10 1v31m0 0 7-8m-7 8-7-8" /></svg>
    </span>
  </a>
</section>
